      "source": "Function used to determine if a <a href=\"ConfigurationPropertySource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties.source\"><code>ConfigurationPropertySource</code></a> should be included\nwhen determining unbound elements. If the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> is a\nsystemEnvironment or systemProperties property source, it will not be considered for\nunbound element failures.",
